                    <p><a href="/mod/824/Keep%20It%20Straight/stats/downloads" class="btn btn-default btn-block">Export Downloads</a></p>
                    <p><a href="/mod/824/Keep%20It%20Straight/stats/followers" class="btn btn-default btn-block">Export Followers</a></p>
                    <p><a href="/mod/824/Keep%20It%20Straight/stats/referrals" class="btn btn-default btn-block">Export Referrals</a></p>
                    <p>Raw stats are from the beginning of time until now.
                    Each follower and download entry represents one hour of data.
                    Uneventful hours are omitted.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

